The '''Tenoo system''' was a [[star system]] located in the [[Bri'ahl sector]] in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]]. The [[planet]]s [[Tenoo]]<ref name="CGSWG">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> and [[Yarrum]] were located here.<ref name="Jason Fry Yarrum" />

